  "notes": "Headline states the outcome; the right side is an abstract product sketch instead of a stock screenshot.",
  "code": "<section class=\"grid w-full max-w-5xl items-center gap-10 px-6 py-16 md:grid-cols-[1.1fr_1fr]\">\n  <div>\n    <h1 class=\"text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-stone-900 md:text-5xl\">\n      Plan the week your team will actually have.\n    </h1>\n    <p class=\"mt-5 max-w-md text-lg text-stone-600\">\n      Drag work onto real calendars, see who is over capacity, and move things before Monday does it for you.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"rounded-md bg-emerald-700 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-emerald-800\">Try it with your calendar</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"rounded-md px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-stone-700 ring-1 ring-stone-300 hover:bg-stone-50\">See a sample week</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"rounded-xl bg-stone-100 p-4 ring-1 ring-stone-200\">\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-5 gap-2 text-xs text-stone-500\">\n      <span>Mon</span><span>Tue</span><span>Wed</span><span>Thu</span><span>Fri</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mt-3 grid grid-cols-5 gap-2\">\n      <div class=\"h-24 rounded-md bg-emerald-200\"></div>\n      <div class=\"h-16 rounded-md bg-amber-200\"></div>\n      <div class=\"h-28 rounded-md bg-rose-200\"></div>\n      <div class=\"h-12 rounded-md bg-emerald-200\"></div>\n      <div class=\"h-20 rounded-md bg-sky-200\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
